OL,3,GNEWSAButler under 'no illusions' about
OL,4,Ascale of new job as health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobbie Butler has said he wants
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland to "have a world-class
OL,8,Fhealth service that people can access
OL,9,Fmore quickly".
OL,11,FThe Ulster Unionist Lagan Valley
OL,12,Fassembly member (MLA) was announced as
OL,13,Fthe new health minister on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe appointment came in the wake of
OL,16,FMike Nesbitt's resignation. He stepped
OL,17,Fdown after UUP leader Jon Burrows said
OL,18,Fhe did not support emergency general
OL,19,Fsurgery (EGS) being removed from
OL,20,FCauseway Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
